scenario: PRINT-01
title: Print to PDF and a PDF viewer
area: Browser
rows: F-BROW-35
machines: any
needs: person
prereq: The Browser tile works and a page is open. No paper printer is needed.
step: On any web page choose Print, then Print to PDF.
expect: A file is saved in your Documents folder with the page inside, correctly paginated.
clause: pdf
step: Open the saved PDF from Files.
expect: The viewer shows the page; zoom in and out and the text stays sharp.
clause: viewer
step: Search for a word you can see on the page.
expect: The viewer finds it and marks it.
clause: search
